 324:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_uart.c ****     This subsection provides a set of functions allowing to initialize the USARTx or the UARTy
 325:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_uart.c ****     in asynchronous mode.
 326:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_uart.c ****       (+) For the asynchronous mode only these parameters can be configured:
 327:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_uart.c ****         (++) Baud Rate
 328:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_uart.c ****         (++) Word Length
 329:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_uart.c ****         (++) Stop Bit
 330:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_uart.c ****         (++) Parity: If the parity is enabled, then the MSB bit of the data written
 331:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_uart.c ****              in the data register is transmitted but is changed by the parity bit.
 332:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_uart.c ****              Depending on the frame length defined by the M bit (8-bits or 9-bits),
 333:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_uart.c ****              please refer to Reference manual for possible UART frame formats.
 334:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_uart.c ****         (++) Hardware flow control
 335:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_uart.c ****         (++) Receiver/transmitter modes
 336:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_uart.c ****         (++) Over Sampling Method
 337:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_uart.c ****     [..]
 338:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_uart.c ****     The HAL_UART_Init(), HAL_HalfDuplex_Init(), HAL_LIN_Init() and HAL_MultiProcessor_Init() APIs
 339:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_uart.c ****     follow respectively the UART asynchronous, UART Half duplex, LIN and Multi-Processor configurat
