 341:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_uart.c ****     (RM0430 for STM32F4X3xx MCUs and RM0402 for STM32F412xx MCUs
 342:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_uart.c ****      RM0383 for STM32F411xC/E MCUs and RM0401 for STM32F410xx MCUs
