 344:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_uart.c ****      RM0390 for STM32F446xx MCUs and RM0386 for STM32F469xx/STM32F479xx MCUs)).
